@SupportCrm.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5223

### Login (agent UI JWT session)
POST {{SupportCrm.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@supportcrm.local",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### Current user (requires a Bearer token from /api/auth/login)
GET {{SupportCrm.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### External API — customers (requires an X-Api-Key with the customers.read scope)
GET {{SupportCrm.Api_HostAddress}}/api/integrations/v1/customers
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
